{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121025","id":4003266021,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7unP3l","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121025","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121025.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121025.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121025","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121025/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121025/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121025/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/719fe49dd0156b20f5ebde6cb9979ad05e2a5ca1","number":121025,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix LoadToken leak in multithreaded resource loading","user":{"login":"DeltachangeOG","id":66188483,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg4NDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66188483?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG","html_url":"https://github.com/DeltachangeOG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Threaded resource loading could leak LoadToken / RefCounted items when using sub-threaded loading.\r\n\r\nCause: _run_load_task ignoring unreference() return values meaning some LoadToken could have no references but never reach cleanup.\r\n\r\n- Closes #120661 \r\n\r\nFix: Make all unreference() calls in _run_load_task final aware, and call memdelete at a safe point if the unreference() returns true. Also add a guard reference in _load_complete_inner that allows it to call _run_load_task and maintain ownership across the function once _run_load_task returns.\r\n\r\nTesting included logging at unreference sites prior to fix and tracking leaked objects hit one of the paths in load_complete_inner that ignored unreference returns. After the fix same logging showed no leaked objects and no errors or issues with resource loading.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","